&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences Principal, Business Development (EMEA), you will partner with EMEA Sales and Sales Engineering leaders to shape and execute the region’s HLS growth strategy. You will connect market opportunity to field execution: prioritizing segments and accounts, developing repeatable vertical and horizontal plays, strengthening the organization and partner ecosystem, and leading critical customer and alliance initiatives. You will be expected to operate comfortably at three levels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Strategic: Define where and how Everpure should win in European healthcare and life sciences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Organizational: Build the capabilities, coverage, relationships, and operating cadence required to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Commercial: Personally advance priority opportunities, alliances, and executive relationships to closed business and measurable customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires a combination of HLS credibility, technical fluency in data and AI platforms, commercial ownership, and the ability to influence across country sales, SE, partners, and corporate teams without relying on formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Pipeline &amp;amp; Financial Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the booking targets and financial performance for the segment by developing and executing a multi year strategic growth plan. Drive and scale the overarching pipeline and bookings targets across the EMEA ecosystem, establishing clear qualification criteria and pipeline visibility.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the EMEA Value Proposition:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Define and articulate the value proposition for Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences to drive growth and establish Everpure as the industry leader.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Execute Joint GTM Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Author and launch strategic go-to-market plans with priority partners, aligning internal cross-functional EMEA teams (Partner Account Teams, Core Sales, Alliances, Marketing) to unlock high-potential HLS customer accounts and activate new revenue streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Strategic Alliances:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Orchestrate strategic vertical alliances and operationalize relationships with key partners to secure reference architectures and joint go to market motions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable and Mobilize the Partner Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip sales teams and partners with the specialized tools, training, and playbooks they need to successfully position and sell vertical solutions. Train and align Partner representatives ensuring they can effectively articulate our value proposition, economic differentiation, and technical sizing for healthcare compliance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Joint Demand Gen &amp;amp; Thought Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Act as a spokesperson for your vertical vision in customer meetings, industry events, analyst briefings, and media opportunities. Build credibility as a principal advisor by shaping the industry narrative around intelligent data foundations and enterprise AI adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HLS &amp;amp; Alliance Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven success leading strategic business development or alliance management within the technology sector, with a deep understanding of customers solutions, cloud economics, and the specific regulatory, data, and compliance needs of the EMEA Healthcare and Life Sciences sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute the global strategy for your segment in partnership with Product Management, Sales, and Engineering teams. A track record of balancing high-level strategy with a &quot;roll-up-your-sleeves&quot; execution mindset, showing a strong ability to build trust and influence executive leaders across partner organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding business acumen and communication skills, with a collaborative approach to thriving in a fast-paced, cross-functional, and multi-cultural EMEA environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; We operate in a hybrid/field-based model. You will be expected to work effectively from a regional corporate office in a key EMEA market, with the ability to travel 25–40% across the region as business needs require.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Keyfactor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our mission is to securely connect the world: humans, machines, and AI. Keyfactor is the leader in trust infrastructure for AI and machines, helping the world&#39;s largest enterprises and government agencies take control of the cryptographic identities that safeguard every digital interaction. Behind the platform is a global team of people who care deeply about the work and each other. We move fast, think big, and show up for one another every day. If you&#39;re looking for work that matters and a team that brings out your best, we hope you&#39;ll trust your future with Keyfactor!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;24682da0-f735-43dd-9919-e0d4caa6d2f0|170&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469775450,&amp;quot;CSS Page Title&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;CSSPageTitle&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134224900,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;40&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;240&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559739,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,134233279,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469777929,&amp;quot;CSS Page Title Char&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Title&amp;quot;]}&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-linked-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;24682da0-f735-43dd-9919-e0d4caa6d2f0|172&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469775450,&amp;quot;CSS Page Title Char&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;CSSPageTitleChar&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134231262,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134224900,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;40&amp;quot;,469777929,&amp;quot;CSS Page Title&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Title Char&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Title:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; Senior Forward Deployed Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; London, United Kingdom (Remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt; Senior level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Job Function:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Professional Services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Full-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;ime&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Industry:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Computer &amp;amp; Network Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Travel Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;25%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;About the position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;1148&quot; data-end=&quot;1518&quot;&gt;The Senior Forward Deployed Engineer is a highly experienced technical practitioner responsible for designing, deploying, and troubleshooting complex customer solutions. This role partners closely with customers and teams across Professional Services, Sales Engineering, Product, and Engineering to solve challenging technical problems and ensure successful deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1520&quot; data-end=&quot;1942&quot;&gt;The Senior FDE brings deep technical expertise to customer engagements, serves as a trusted technical advisor, and helps translate real-world customer requirements and field insights into improvements across our products and delivery practices. This role also contributes to reusable architectures, integration patterns, and technical best practices while providing guidance and mentorship to other technical team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bzifu5&quot; data-start=&quot;1970&quot; data-end=&quot;2058&quot;&gt;Lead the technical design and execution of complex customer solutions and deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hgcu02&quot; data-start=&quot;2059&quot; data-end=&quot;2184&quot;&gt;Assess technical feasibility, architecture, risks, dependencies, and integration requirements across customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vh6x80&quot; data-start=&quot;2185&quot; data-end=&quot;2307&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve complex technical and deployment challenges, partnering with Product and Engineering as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;f8986a&quot; data-start=&quot;2308&quot; data-end=&quot;2405&quot;&gt;Serve as a senior technical resource and escalation point for challenging customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jusl7c&quot; data-start=&quot;2406&quot; data-end=&quot;2526&quot;&gt;Develop and contribute to reusable reference architectures, integration patterns, tools, and technical best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14e7wnv&quot; data-start=&quot;2527&quot; data-end=&quot;2674&quot;&gt;Identify recurring technical challenges in the field and collaborate with Product, Engineering, and delivery teams to develop scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ki2uws&quot; data-start=&quot;2675&quot; data-end=&quot;2791&quot;&gt;Translate customer requirements and field insights into actionable product feedback and technical recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qmb8ly&quot; data-start=&quot;2792&quot; data-end=&quot;2930&quot;&gt;Provide technical guidance throughout the customer lifecycle, from late-stage presales through implementation and production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hbkfoo&quot; data-start=&quot;2931&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor to customers and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t1fzi1&quot; data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3099&quot;&gt;Mentor and provide technical guidance to FDEs and other technical team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4qmxew&quot; data-start=&quot;3100&quot; data-end=&quot;3196&quot;&gt;Contribute to improvements in deployment consistency, scalability, and customer time-to-value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lh4dnb&quot; data-start=&quot;3197&quot; data-end=&quot;3328&quot;&gt;Collaborate across Professional Services, Sales Engineering, Product, and Engineering to improve the overall customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications, Education, and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wk858s&quot; data-start=&quot;3381&quot; data-end=&quot;3525&quot;&gt;Significant experience designing and deploying enterprise security, cloud, infrastructure, or SaaS solutions in complex customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h9adjl&quot; data-start=&quot;3526&quot; data-end=&quot;3655&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in enterprise integrations, APIs, distributed systems, networking, identity, security, and cloud technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ukz157&quot; data-start=&quot;3656&quot; data-end=&quot;3754&quot;&gt;Proven ability to independently diagnose and resolve complex and ambiguous technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rpe4mj&quot; data-start=&quot;3755&quot; data-end=&quot;3850&quot;&gt;Experience across solution architecture, presales, implementation, and production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;f9a1c8&quot; data-start=&quot;3851&quot; data-end=&quot;3975&quot;&gt;Experience developing or contributing to reusable technical architectures, integration patterns, tools, or best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6fmvyp&quot; data-start=&quot;3976&quot; data-end=&quot;4127&quot;&gt;Strong customer-facing communication skills with the ability to communicate complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18bt6wi&quot; data-start=&quot;4128&quot; data-end=&quot;4265&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate with and influence Product, Engineering, and other cross-functional teams without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5lzs44&quot; data-start=&quot;4266&quot; data-end=&quot;4383&quot;&gt;Ability to operate with a high degree of autonomy while effectively managing multiple complex customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rduweo&quot; data-start=&quot;4384&quot; data-end=&quot;4472&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring or providing technical guidance to other technical practitioners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-NA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary will be commensurate with experience. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture, Career Opportunities and Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build teams that continually strive to get better than the day before. You will be challenged daily and given opportunities to grow personally and professionally. We balance autonomy and structure to create an entrepreneurial environment to spur creativity and new ideas. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are just some of the initiatives that make our culture special:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Second Fridays (a company-wide day off on the second Friday of every month minus November and December due to the Holiday schedule). Please note that this benefit is subject to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive benefit coverage globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave is available to new parents. Structure varies based on regional/government requirements. In regions where government-paid leave doesn’t exist, like in the U.S., the company offers generous paid parental leave, along with comprehensive adoption and fertility support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive time off globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated employee-focused ambassadors via Key Contributors &amp;amp; Culture Committees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DIVERSE Commitment, a call to action for a more inclusive and diverse future in business, society, and technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Keyfactor Alliance Program to support DEIB efforts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing resources, wellness allowance, mindfulness app free membership, Wellness Wednesdays.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Volunteer Day, company non-profit matching, and 3 volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Talent development and Cross Functional meetings to support professional development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular All Hands meetings – followed by group gatherings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Core Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our core values are extremely important to how we run our business and what we look for in every team member:  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; is paramount.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We deliver security software and solutions where trust and openness are of the highest importance for our customers. We are honest and a trusted partner in every aspect of business.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; are core.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strategize, operate, and execute through a customer-centric view. We prioritize the security interests of our customers, and we act as if their data were our own.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; never stops, it only accelerates.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The speed of change is accelerating. We are committed, through investment and focus, to stay ahead of the innovation curve.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We deliver with &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;agility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We thrive in high-paced and continually changing environments. We navigate through newly added variables, adjust accordingly, while driving towards our strategic goals.  &lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;United by &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;respect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Respect for all is what unites us. We promote diversity, inclusivity, equity, and acting with empathy and openness, both in our business and in our communities.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; make “it” happen.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vision and goals are not individually achievable – they require teamwork. We pride ourselves in operating as a cohesive team, creating promoters and partners, and winning as one.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
