&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven track record of leading large-scale, enterprise or multi-market client portfolios within a media agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Demonstrable success in leading multi-tiered teams, driving high team retention, talent development, and operational resource planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Pitch Capability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven record of supporting new business and growing organic client revenue, with a strong understanding of agency commercial models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Mastery &amp;amp; JBPs:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;In-depth, expert-level knowledge of major advertising platforms (Meta Ads Manager, TikTok Ads Manager, Pinterest Ads Manager, Snap, LinkedIn) alongside experience managing platform partner relationships and JBPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Measurement &amp;amp; Effectiveness:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven capability in implementing sophisticated measurement frameworks including incrementality / lift testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Outstanding verbal, written, and pitch presentation skills, with the ability to articulate complex strategic narratives effortlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Portfolio Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Masterful organizational skills with the ability to balance competing strategic priorities, client accounts, and agency-wide initiatives seamlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in paid social media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform certifications (e.g., Meta Blueprint, TikTok Certifications).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
