&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Parloa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa&#39;s mission is to make every customer conversation feel effortless for both customers and the companies serving them. As agentic AI accelerates, Parloans are shaping the foundation of a new era in customer experience, one where customer support is no longer transactions, but meaningful exchanges. It is not just a vision; Parloa has powered over ONE BILLION interactions between global enterprise brands and their customers, with companies like Booking.com, HealthEquity, Allianz, SAP, BarmeniaGothaer, and TUI already deploying Parloa at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Sr Partner Delivery Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own and scale strategic relationships with Parloa&#39;s global SI, consulting, and implementation partners, ensuring they can deliver transformative AI and customer experience solutions for enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is your opportunity to shape how enterprise partners adopt, scale, and operationalize agentic AI, helping define Partner Success at one of the fastest-growing AI companies in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Areas of ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Own a portfolio of strategic Parloa partners, building trusted relationships with partner executives, practice leads, delivery managers, architects, and customer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as strategic advisor to partners on building and scaling their Parloa services practice, covering delivery methodologies, organizational structure, certifications, and go-to-market motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide partners through complex enterprise AI and CX transformation programs, monitor partner-led implementations, and proactively manage risks and escalations to drive successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Account Executives and Partner Managers on strategic deals, and ensure close alignment between partners and internal teams across Customer Success, Professional Services, Product, and Solution Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive operational rigor through governance structures, success metrics, delivery reviews, and executive business reviews, while helping scale Partner Success programs, playbooks, and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in enterprise SaaS, consulting, partner management, customer success, or professional services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record working with global systems integrators, consulting firms, or implementation partners to drive measurable customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise delivery models, implementation methodologies (SAFe Agile, waterfall), and project governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence, able to lead executive reviews and communicate confidently with partner leadership, customer executives, and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English is required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
