&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

