&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior Manager, HR Operations to lead our HR Operations function across Europe, Asia and LATAM. In this role, you’ll translate global HR strategy into scalable programs, policies and service delivery standards while serving as a trusted advisor on complex governance and risk management across multiple international regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, HR Operations, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategy and advisory.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll shape the roadmap for international HR operations, aligning global policy with local needs while acting as a trusted advisor to senior leaders across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead governance and compliance.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll manage end-to-end compliance across employment contracts, the employee lifecycle, global mobility, benefits, payroll and health and safety protocols across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize processes.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll leverage automation and AI to scale operational efficiency, manage vendor relationships and execute key initiatives like policy overhauls or M&amp;amp;A integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop team talent.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll directly manage our HR Operations Manager and coach the broader regional team, setting service-level standards and using metrics to showcase operational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We’re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London or Barcelona. You’ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced manager.&lt;/strong&gt; You bring 10+ years of HR operations experience, including at least five years managing teams in a global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International compliance expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; You have deep working knowledge of employment law, payroll, benefits and compliance across multiple countries, with strong experience in European regions like the U.K., Spain, Italy and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluent.&lt;/strong&gt; You have proven experience leveraging AI tools to optimize operations and improve workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process builder.&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at creating scalable, automated processes across complex regulatory landscapes while balancing hands-on execution with long-term strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaborator.&lt;/strong&gt; You build strong partnerships with Legal, Finance and IT, comfortably managing vendor negotiations and influencing senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multilingual.&lt;/strong&gt; Conversational or fluent Spanish skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certified professional.&lt;/strong&gt; SHRM-SCP, GPHR or equivalent certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced degree.&lt;/strong&gt; Master&#39;s degree in HR, Business or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We’ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you’ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We’ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you’re at the office or working remotely, we’ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you’re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£75,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£125,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Hudl&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hudl is an equal opportunity employer. Through our actions, behaviors and attitude, we’ll create an environment where everyone, no matter their differences, feels like they belong.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer resources to ensure our employees feel safe bringing their authentic selves to work, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/about-inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;including employee resource groups and communities&lt;/a&gt;. But we recognize there’s ongoing work to be done, which is why we track our efforts and commitments in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/about-inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;annual inclusion reports&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We also know imposter syndrome is real and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2014/05/the-confidence-gap/359815/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;confidence gap&lt;/a&gt; can get in the way of meeting spectacular candidates. Please don’t hesitate to apply—we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer with a &lt;strong&gt;minimum of 15 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll work on our in-house package, &#39;Miles,&#39; an ERP software for automotive finance, leasing, fleet, and mobility management. This end-to-end solution encompasses front, mid, and back-office functions that can be extensively customized to the customers’ needs through configuration and custom development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of a multidisciplinary team that includes other developers, business consultants, and testers, covering our end-to-end business flow. You can rely on a broad base of knowledge and expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every team in Sofico works in an agile way, including scrum, daily stand-ups, and backlog refinement. Additionally, you’ll be joining our Java community, which connects all the Software Engineers within Sofico worldwide to share best practices, code, tips, and tricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Right Fit for the Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for developing and building solutions is at the top of our list. As a Software Engineer, it is also key to keep the bigger picture in mind and understand how different elements are intertwined. Problem-solving is one of your strongest abilities, and you approach it methodically. If you are a team player who &lt;strong&gt;enjoys collaborating &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;sharing knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;, you’re the perfect blend of technical and soft skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position, based in &lt;strong&gt;Sydney&lt;/strong&gt;, offers a hybrid work model: three days in-office and two days remote.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Candidates must possess full working rights in Australia; sponsorship is not available.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your application, elaborate on the following aspects of your career:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience spanning over &lt;strong&gt;15 years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise as either a Full Stack Developer or specialized in Back End development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Java 17, Java EE 7, SQL/JPA, Hibernate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Agile&lt;/strong&gt; Methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;Automotive, Finance, or Leasing&lt;/strong&gt; industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;Monolithic &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Microservices&lt;/strong&gt; architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significance in constructing and deploying solutions, both internally and for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engagement in enhancing current applications, developing new modules, or executing customization projects for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstration of adeptly &lt;strong&gt;resolving complex problems&lt;/strong&gt; in a systematic manner, with project-specific details provided in your application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, including client interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, given our international and multicultural environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About Us&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover how Sofico empowers businesses in 27 countries worldwide. With offices in Australia, Belgium, France, Germany, Japan, Mexico, the Netherlands, and the UK, our Sydney-based hub manages clients across Australia and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our flagship product, Miles, has completed over 60 successful implementations and earned a solid reputation in automotive finance, leasing, fleet, and mobility management. It&#39;s an ERP system renowned for its unmatched flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sofico operates at the intersection of rapidly transforming industries: automotive, finance, leasing, and IT. This convergence sparks innovation as our clients pioneer new product offerings, focusing on mobility solutions enabled by connected cars.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us—a multinational company with over 600 staff—as we lead the way in industry innovation. Unlock new possibilities with Sofico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What We Offer&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico, we welcome you to an international and multicultural company that has been thriving for over 30 years and is doubling in size every five years. Growth is in our DNA, and we strongly uphold our horizontal and open company culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take control of your career with a focus on personal development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an extensive six-month onboarding program, supported by a dedicated job coach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy continuous opportunities for learning and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a modern, state-of-the-art office that&#39;s easily accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite parking and walking distance from metro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a competitive salary, flexible office hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid option to work from home two days a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access novated leasing options and mobile phone reimbursement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy complimentary coffee, soft drinks, breakfast and fruit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in team events, including afterwork drinks, BBQs, family days, and company weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to join a dynamic team and take your career to the next level, apply today!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Category Manager Packaging &amp;amp; Sustainability, you will report to the Senior International Category Manager for Packaging. You will collaborate on developing and leading the category strategy, drive process improvement initiatives across Australia and New Zealand, and act as a point of escalation for operational matters. We are looking for an ambitious, confident, entrepreneurial, and high-spirited Sustainability &amp;amp; Procurement professional with a strength for data processing, optimization, and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Chippendale, Sydney and reporting to the Senior International Category Manager for Packaging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, optimize, and align the packaging supplier network and Category Strategy across Australia and New Zealand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create ongoing data analysis and category reviews to drive strategic performance and achieve ambitious targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in providing procurement advice, price updates, reporting, invoice approval, replenishment, compliance, and tenders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with suppliers to build strong long-term relationships and execute contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project manage and coordinate the preparation of all Non-Financial Reporting and monthly GHG scope data for the ANZ market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive local sustainability optimization projects, including energy efficiency, renewable energy transition, and packaging innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate required Scope 3 carbon reduction initiatives and act as the local point of contact for all regional sustainability work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of strategic procurement, sustainability, supply chain, or commercial consulting experience (ideally in food/FMCG).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Business, Supply Chain, Sustainability, Economics, or Procurement (or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound understanding of Sustainability drivers locally including APCO, and conceptual understanding of ‘How to” impact sustainability, primarily focussed on Packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the packaging arena, including material specifications, supplier markets, and running regional tenders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative and analytical expertise, with a solid comfort level using Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, flexible, and assertive, with a strong ability to take ownership of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and able to prioritize your workload effectively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial, driven by a sense of urgency, and capable of making things happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with travel requirements of up to 10% of your time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full time role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Chippendale Head Office - hybrid working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
